  "question": {
    "text": "A solid is formed and it has three types of atoms X, Y and Z. X forms a fcc lattice with Y atoms occupying all tetrahedral voids and Z atoms occupying half of octahedral voids. The formula of solid is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
